# A Vessel Without a Captain (CoP 3-2, mission.cop.a_vessel_without_a_captain). A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with
# 3-2 current (a GM; Status 0). Metalworks Cid: 861, once a zone (the second trigger: nothing). Lower Jeuno _6tc
# (Status 0): 86; finished: Status 1. Harnek (Status 1): event 12. Ru'Lude Gardens' trigger area 1 (Status 1), The
# Shadow Lord not completed: 65; finished: the mission completes (3-3 current).
lists Metalworks/Cid/onTrigger LowerJeuno/_6tc/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Harnek/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/65
char zone=Metalworks pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain current
login
trigger Cid                             # 861
finish-if-event
trigger Cid                             # once a zone: nothing
finish-if-event
warp 15.5,-0.1,-6.1 LowerJeuno
trigger Harnek                          # Status 0: nothing
finish-if-event
trigger _6tc                            # Status 0: 86
finish                                  # Status 1
trigger Harnek                          # Status 1: event 12
finish-if-event
warp 0,3,10 RuludeGardens
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 0,3,50                             # trigger area 1, Status 1: 65
finish                                  # complete: 3-3 current
